# November 23, 2026: Nova Scotia outside Annapolis and Lunenburg counties: Halifax, Cape Breton (Louisbourg), Hants, Kings,
# Colchester, Pictou, Cumberland and Yarmouth counties. Region ns, the thinnest ground, claimed with tools/choose.py --thinnest.
# Sources opened: Canadian Register of Historic Places statements (historicplaces.ca, read with tools/page.py), Parks Canada's
# hours pages for the Halifax Citadel, Fortress of Louisbourg and Grand-Pré, the Nova Scotia Museum's own sites for Clifton and
# Uniacke, Wikipedia (read as raw text), and the ArcGIS geocoder and OpenStreetMap for positions.
